# an executable pays nothing: the table of the build is the table, no lock is left to the program, and the code is what member-that-nobody-writes-is-locked-and-constant.ir has
# RUN: test-run
# CHECK: left-to-program 0
# RUN(NEVER): test-run
# NEVER-NOT: replaces
# RUN(LOCKS): locks open
# LOCKS-NOT: MathImul
# RUN(WALK): walk f0 mechanisms=all
# WALK-LABEL: code f0:Body
# WALK-NOT: key="imul"
# PROGRAM-OF: member-that-nobody-writes-is-locked-and-constant.ir
